1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:01,020
Can she survive

2
00:00:01,050 --> 00:00:03,200
twelve miles at minus twenty?

3
00:00:03,750 --> 00:00:04,920
Within an hour,

4
00:00:04,950 --> 00:00:06,550
her eyelashes freeze.

5
00:00:07,100 --> 00:00:08,240
Rule number three:

6
00:00:08,270 --> 00:00:09,530
check your toes,

7
00:00:09,560 --> 00:00:10,610
every hour.

8
00:00:11,160 --> 00:00:12,090
At hour six,

9
00:00:12,120 --> 00:00:14,510
three toes turn white.

10
00:00:15,050 --> 00:00:15,590
She warms them on

11
00:00:15,620 --> 00:00:17,000
Ember's belly.

12
00:00:17,540 --> 00:00:18,890
To save two hours,

13
00:00:18,920 --> 00:00:20,510
they cross a frozen lake.

14
00:00:21,060 --> 00:00:22,830
The ice is four inches thick,

15
00:00:22,860 --> 00:00:24,240
and then it cracks.

16
00:00:24,780 --> 00:00:25,890
She drops flat,

17
00:00:25,920 --> 00:00:27,210
to spread her weight.

18
00:00:27,750 --> 00:00:29,250
Then, a white column

19
00:00:29,280 --> 00:00:31,860
of steam, dead ahead.

20
00:00:32,400 --> 00:00:33,510
Eagle Hot Spring.

21
00:00:33,540 --> 00:00:35,370
Thirty-eight degrees inside.

22
00:00:35,910 --> 00:00:36,420
But somebody is

23
00:00:36,450 --> 00:00:37,830
already there.

24
00:00:38,380 --> 00:00:39,550
Forty people, crowded

25
00:00:39,580 --> 00:00:41,480
around one small pool.

26
00:00:42,020 --> 00:00:43,400
Their leader steps out,

27
00:00:43,430 --> 00:00:44,670
and blocks the door.

28
00:00:45,210 --> 00:00:46,200
“We have no room for

29
00:00:46,230 --> 00:00:48,220
more mouths,” he says.

30
00:00:48,770 --> 00:00:49,550
Mara holds up

31
00:00:49,580 --> 00:00:50,800
her jar of seeds.

32
00:00:51,350 --> 00:00:52,790
“Seeds need light.”

33
00:00:52,820 --> 00:00:53,780
“We have none.”

34
00:00:54,320 --> 00:00:59,530
Part four. A garden in the dark. Follow for part four.
